 with pupillary function.\nAnswer ________________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 271, "answer": {"text": "D", "source": {"id": "offline-64c47c441fb7bc94def2", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 16.pdf", "sha256": "64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Utilization of information and clinical experience from neurodevelopment in\ndifferent ways.\nAnswer_____________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 334, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-64c47c441fb7bc94def2", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 16.pdf", "sha256": "64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Development of autism.\nAnswer______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 450, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-64c47c441fb7bc94def2", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 16.pdf", "sha256": "64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faeabd366a1f.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/64c47c441fb7bc94def2ff0a834db876964fb739a389b189f258faea